  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop and event facilitation on the pre-feasibility studies developed for WaL Cartagena</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate change effects and water-related challenges are very visible in the city of Cartagena, Colombia. Innovative solutions are required, in order to address these challenges in an integrated way, resulting in implementable proposals. This assignment focuses on the organisation of workshops and complementary activities with the aim to share and discuss the design proposals and pre-feasibility studies for five projects within the Water as Leverage (WaL) Cartagena program with city representatives, technical experts, community representatives and other stakeholders required to ensure an inclusive process.</narrative>
  </description>
